{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "d3189f87640cb0100698e900d06923d422663acdf08f066ef4eb1c7bc89845d2", "ja": "MC MC　リバーサイド", "zh": "MC MC 河畔", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fab5c4e52a2d35990b152a89be923a41fa18952ff2ac825fbc4749d6935fd951", "ja": "何故か始まる真美と亜美の決闘。言葉をぶつ\nけ合う双子を見守るプロデューサーと律子。\nマジなバトルの後、仲良くなった様子のふた\nりに、律子もふたりとバトルすると言う。数\n多の戦いを越え……輝け、アイドルラップ！", "zh": "不知为何，真美和亚美开始了决斗。制作人与律子守望着互相用言语交锋的双胞胎。\n在一场认真的战斗后，看到两人似乎变得要好了，律子也说要和她们两个对决。跨越无数战斗……闪耀吧，偶像说唱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1000_se", "source_sha256": "1a0e8177db79b83383821a64a4fdb633e9bd49ac5b6cb83a72e56b234ecb5075", "ja": "ヒュォォオォオ～……", "zh": "呼——呜呜呜～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5d82fae88fa09500f5ca3985275b6edcc36a468359651b37f6b6601caf9358a4", "ja": "（うっ、すごい風だ！　しかし決闘だなんて、\n真美はどこに……あっ、意外と近所にいた！？）", "zh": "（呜，好大的风！不过说到决斗，真美在哪里……啊，居然就在这附近！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "c63508ac6947adc06216346cda7787bbc7ab72b0cf7a4d3b3a345ef62f0d6403", "ja": "久しいな、亜美……ついにこの日がやってきたな。", "zh": "好久不见，亚美……这一天终于到来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "6fd38654dabaa6992dc7e056ef296ab40bbdd9fd71ab34953f4b6f1f5229be2a", "ja": "ああ、真美。この日を何年待ちわびていたことか……。", "zh": "啊，真美。我们盼望这一天，已经等了多少年啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "9a685d142335ec4e9fbc44860811a3320159fb4ba068200e07f833583efc44b5", "ja": "急に電話で呼び出されて、何事かと思ったけど。\nそういうことなら、審判は私達にまかせなさい！", "zh": "突然打电话把我叫出来，我还以为出什么事了呢。\n既然是这么回事，裁判就包在我们身上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1005_p", "source_sha256": "80e9249873c27eea3e9828b536bab8308426f70e0f476251085bc0866add786f", "ja": "律子まで呼んでたのか。いつの間に……。", "zh": "连律子都叫来了吗。究竟是什么时候……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "ee0a03b08cce76df25dd3d56bed683d5ac09eadb0e90c225e44fecce8bc7be9e", "ja": "いざ、勝負！\n先手は譲ろう。いざ……！", "zh": "来决胜负吧！\n先攻就让给你了。来吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "503144a23a1a6731ffb745fec1b9daac5a4a46e4b667f1e8ad4119d4a5a9fe1b", "ja": "え？　普通、ラップバトルって\n後攻のほうが有利なんじゃ……？", "zh": "诶？一般来说，饶舌对决不是后手更有利吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1861406f0459ba348a9644797394f1d3caff6202e62e1162f4728cdcfcc9098f", "ja": "ああ。真美、本気で勝ちに行くつもりだ……！", "zh": "啊。真美是打算认真去争取胜利的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1009_null", "source_sha256": "298feffac94f48b8ccbaac99f2367ea8d9e597a9ff31edc38a2f1258ecab55f0", "ja": "バトル！！", "zh": "战斗！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "31d0cd3136880c4772d4c6dca604a4c7fc72438f5fa0480c6c0086cbae104357", "ja": "HEY YO　真美　亜美の真似ばかりする真美　\nフェイク野郎　決着つけよう", "zh": "HEY YO　真美　只会学亚美的真美　\n冒牌货　做个了断吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "d83c9924bd0f172bdf0da251794f1fc7b2a71a012d84f65cba8ac28864a43629", "ja": "フェイク野郎？　真美は真美　真実（しんじつ）\nと書いて真美　つまりTRUE　真美こそがリアル", "zh": "冒牌货？真美就是真美——“真实”的真美！也就是TRUE，真美才是真正的存在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "30f6b387ea93f967dd84007309b45dbfd726af774e45affcbd36b0ea93be8528", "ja": "なんだと？　コラ　真美　LIKE A　デビル\nヤキニクマン　倒す亜美　LIKE A　ヤキニクマン", "zh": "什么？！喂，真美，简直像个恶魔！  \n打倒烤肉超人的亚美，简直像个烤肉超人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "1b53349c8eb045ba2b907c8bafc6a6fe54ca12dbc7624e9343af274a41473843", "ja": "なんか、ただの姉妹喧嘩にも見えますけど……\n{$P$}、止めなくていいんですか？", "zh": "看起来就像普通的姐妹吵架，不过……\n{$P$}，不用阻止她们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1014_p", "source_sha256": "52d9fec70b5d7e6dc93d2996c3089db94e6af038aa28f84d916edb0721e8532d", "ja": "そうだな……今は見守ろう。これは双子のリアルな\nプライドがかかった真剣勝負なんだ……多分。", "zh": "是啊……现在先在旁边看着吧。这可是赌上双胞胎真正骄傲的认真对决……大概。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "9e88e1c118d157295506f7017d066ece3d8f39b435a8fe09af845f59fedb2251", "ja": "毎日思ってた　生まれた時から一緒\nそうさこの13年　そんなアティチュードじゃ不安定", "zh": "每天都在想　从出生起就一直在一起\n没错，这13年　抱着那种态度可不稳定", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1016_012mam", "source_sha256": "a6c1f8218cace7c1762fa98f45dc64cc09b2b9f1bdbda012d8e0df0dad159433", "ja": "不安定こそが通過点　真美は行く群馬県\nざっけんなコラ！　ギスギス上等だオラ！！", "zh": "不稳定才是必经之路，真美要去群马县\n开什么玩笑！剑拔弩张才叫痛快，喂！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "6ed9a95f29d6a15899e1e33cb99f41d5d7b9d3b348b99e80d67876e3118cdcca", "ja": "なんで群馬県？　っていうか急にガラわるっ！", "zh": "为什么是群马县？话说，怎么突然变得这么凶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4712d99b708da3b41fb0e84358f3976fe788511d886747a31a336616eb6d3138", "ja": "わからない。だが、本気のイキりだ……。", "zh": "不知道。不过，这是认真的装腔作势……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "3230986053155d6a35e3c715a6f80cf806b40cad9887da3375a78e08fa432242", "ja": "イキるだけで低いスキル　飼い犬の遠吠え\n……じゃなくてあれだ、吠える犬は……うるさい？", "zh": "光会嚣张，技能低下，家犬的远吠  \n……不对，应该说，乱叫的狗……很吵？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1020_012mam", "source_sha256": "0939793b4c611fb5baddb8d0e3f020921d9a90d3fb2005505ad526592f24e634", "ja": "おいおいどうした踏めてない　いつものスタイル\n貫くはずが　真美の攻撃　きいてるようだな", "zh": "哎呀哎呀，怎么啦？连韵都押不上了，这可是你一贯的风格啊  \n本该贯彻到底才对，看来真美的攻击挺有效嘛", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1021_011ami", "source_sha256": "7a907bb04ecb8a4e19282690b68d9ce9a1d161dda0b18ed728e86d92bbbba89c", "ja": "ぐっ……あ、亜美は貫くスタイル！\n真美のたじろぐスマイル！　不適な笑みは不安の現れ！", "zh": "呃……啊、亚美要贯彻自己的风格！  \n真美那退缩的笑容！那副无所畏惧的笑容正是不安的表现！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1022_012mam", "source_sha256": "a5c2a028fa41af3160790ec1d7f7736d4bcc73b78d9fad7aefb0928eb6e8a5e1", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪　を超えて　ウッホッホ～！\nウホホ、ウホ　ウホウホ　ウホホ！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪已经过时了，看我的呜呵呵～！\n呜呵呵、呜呵　呜呵呜呵　呜呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1023_011ami", "source_sha256": "315d14db461b0c6175b84a67af71425c64409e4e8bf95f9102e63d4c21497e3d", "ja": "えっ、ちょ、待ってよ真美！　ゴリラは反則でしょ？", "zh": "诶，等、等一下啦，真美！大猩猩也太犯规了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1024_012mam", "source_sha256": "bc129f715fdd5450dbad71845c9eaee03f42c227934312982e7e5ba2a9b7ff0e", "ja": "真美ゴリゴリ　マジの感性これで完成？　夢中夢中\n亜美もはや眼中ない　このトゥナイト　ゴリ五里霧中", "zh": "真美猛猛　真正的感性这样就完成？　沉迷沉迷  \n亜美早已不在眼中　就在这个夜晚　猛陷五里雾中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1025_011ami", "source_sha256": "902e94936c94a2873f8693f17109ab11f598448372b031fe0ed4bf9270b176f4", "ja": "……っ。", "zh": "……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1026_009rit", "source_sha256": "cb99744dc8fab0b856da2f14b126bb1293f013cf807bfbdd40cabe601a2ee989", "ja": "と、止まった！？　亜美のMCが……。", "zh": "停、停下来了！？亜美的MC……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
