{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1028_011ami", "source_sha256": "226952e8fd3c34396535efd05db4bb00d33a1c8bb28e9e6b69cd41b904d972ad", "ja": "ううっ……なんで？　どうして！\nこうなったら……えいっ！！", "zh": "呜呜……为什么？为什么会这样！\n既然这样……嘿咻！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
