{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1037_009rit", "source_sha256": "a82f22a196c967c93b28907dc2591d3108be6d1040c62638030ddc1fa5867360", "ja": "ふたりとも、やりすぎよ。いい？　ラップバトルは\n手を出したら負け。あくまでも口喧嘩の勝負なの。", "zh": "你们两个，都做得太过火了。听好了，Rap Battle一旦动手就输了。归根结底，这可是斗嘴的较量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1040_009rit", "source_sha256": "ce9bef64006144111acb4e52ce943932c0b17186345a36b99d5f5601b8496302", "ja": "昔……ヒップホップ発祥の地・ブロンクスでは、\n暴力が蔓延していたそうよ。でも、人々は思った。", "zh": "很久以前……据说，在嘻哈发源地布朗克斯，暴力无处不在。但人们想道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1041_009rit", "source_sha256": "7ec9d48746a9a3f817c85e50f8b44d49fd3ea1c7b08b8ede1aae5c709a5ede7e", "ja": "もう傷つきたくはない。けれど暴力から逃げるのでは\nなく……別のバトルで戦って、争いを解決しようと。", "zh": "不想再受到伤害了。但也不是要逃避暴力……\n而是想通过另一种对决来战斗，以此平息纷争。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1042_009rit", "source_sha256": "289f61a45201b574f46eb5e1486ab33493b87e191989202f128d7195643c1ce9", "ja": "そして生まれたのがヒップホップ、そしてラップよ。\nあなた達の戦いはどうなの？　フェイク？　リアル？", "zh": "由此诞生的就是嘻哈，还有说唱。\n你们的战斗又如何呢？是虚假的，还是认真的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1043_012mam", "source_sha256": "018382d9728ec603ea33fb85b547487699b700f1e6b1f81d4e0aba6698f742f3", "ja": "ま、真美はシンケンだよ！", "zh": "真、真美可是认真的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1044_011ami", "source_sha256": "9e201bddf0780b9c4897c112ad2c688ee10d24db2dd9b908234049faa4a15ade", "ja": "亜美だって、ホンキだよ！", "zh": "亜美也是认真的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1045_009rit", "source_sha256": "99e9974ae2f94642792d4d588a6e8ac94849aa4cfa8ac03de89ef89f2744b2f3", "ja": "そう。本気なら、正々堂々とやりましょう。でも、\n今日はもう遅いから……ね、{$P$}。", "zh": "没错。既然是认真的，那就堂堂正正地来吧。不过，今天已经很晚了……对吧，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1046_p", "source_sha256": "0088cf48965bf7e602ebe7008da93434e21eac3d2c99124b27e937fd87eb4c6e", "ja": "ああ。この続きは明日にしよう。必ず。約束だ。", "zh": "啊。剩下的明天再继续吧。一定。说好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1047_012mam", "source_sha256": "c752706280c1589df27c495ac486583f115fd64007fbe66a33fd6f902033ddc8", "ja": "うん……わかったよ。兄ちゃん、律っちゃん……！", "zh": "嗯……我知道了。哥、律子姐……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
