{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1050_012mam", "source_sha256": "9c91c7881b76d999484d7c95d5d6d254d2d676f1fedb24870f67ed80a5cc26f9", "ja": "HEY YO　亜美　最愛のSISTER　お前のこと\nマジリスペクト　真似なんかじゃない　元から似てる", "zh": "HEY YO 亚美 最爱的SISTER 对你\n真心RESPECT 才不是在模仿 本来就很像", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1051_011ami", "source_sha256": "449dd5283c95727d3f7e6e89eabbd0a3fe294be6fed092dc3e4f4c2ab049f371", "ja": "似てるってことは仲いいってこと　つまりは\nLOVE　愛さえあれば　なんとかなるっしょ♪", "zh": "像就说明关系好，也就是说——LOVE！只要有爱，总会有办法的吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1052_009rit", "source_sha256": "e6a23f99daf845cf4fee75b694949cc1ab46c2391b419689bcded66155b9cbea", "ja": "ふああ……あっ、{$P$}。\nおはようございます。", "zh": "哈啊……啊，{$P$}。\n早上好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1053_p", "source_sha256": "d4b227b39e5c89156bd37e8b859e982f8152d046a3f5f57e17861ad6e7b61280", "ja": "おはよう。寝不足か、律子？", "zh": "早上好。睡眠不足吗，律子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1054_009rit", "source_sha256": "9f2b234bf4be13bae9b400d92e8c6a02534078bf336cd794c63f53d94d84186c", "ja": "まあ、ちょっと……でも、ひと晩経ったら\nふたりともすっかり元通りみたいで、安心しました。", "zh": "嗯，稍微有一点……不过，过了一晚之后\n两个人好像完全恢复如初了，我也就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1055_p", "source_sha256": "9f20d027d13a061a9b28666f8d5342b68d9cf3dd3d4ddec28cb9c60bfdbf62f4", "ja": "元通りか。……もしかしたら、前よりもっと\n仲良くなったのかもしれないな。", "zh": "恢复原样吗。……说不定，她们的关系比以前更好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1056_009rit", "source_sha256": "d7be7299f82b2d8bb11cf18f3c49e1f1d066671bfec0190942101d7b2d7177b6", "ja": "ふふっ、そうかもしれませんね。……よしっ。\n私もふたりと、仲良く口喧嘩してみますか！", "zh": "呵呵，也许吧。……好！\n那我也和你们两个来一场友好的斗嘴吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1057_012mam", "source_sha256": "ddcb342ce07462e3a46def34051b1aff51be5205ad8c627d44622f05b564095f", "ja": "あ、律っちゃん！　さっそくやる？　戦っちゃう？\n自分で言うのもなんだけど、真美すごいよ？", "zh": "啊，律子！要马上开始吗？要开战吗？\n虽然这么夸自己有点那个，但真美很厉害哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1058_011ami", "source_sha256": "cecb0373811ef0d8b874eb4017b900391e0cd37f8572b9d6d9f53908233b90fc", "ja": "亜美は絶対負けないよ。真美はどうだか知らないけど。", "zh": "亚美绝对不会输哦。真美会怎么样就不知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1059_009rit", "source_sha256": "b8f2e9adc0c19fb4d017c7347ba56d7bbf5f36b37b33f4742c9d7593a0c125df", "ja": "ほーら、また。私達アイドルなんだし、\nここはアイドルらしく戦いましょうね？　YEAH？", "zh": "你看，又来了。我们可是偶像，\n就要像偶像一样战斗，对吧？YEAH？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1062_p", "source_sha256": "ca9d58e7b4f176f5263b2ee58603ca7776a19730c25d6fec9f57330e543dbb84", "ja": "（多くの戦いを経て……3人とも、以前の何倍も\nタフになったかもしれないな。だが……）", "zh": "（经历了许多战斗……这3人也许都比以前坚韧了好几倍。不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0176_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_06_1063_p", "source_sha256": "fc0e9e4f37e16d6df9cf378f9ad65d37312e7251c6d328b79a59067beee353d7", "ja": "（本当の勝負はさらに先にある。すべてのしがらみと\n既成概念を壊して……輝け、アイドルラップ！！）", "zh": "（真正的较量还在更前方。打破所有束缚和成见……闪耀吧，偶像说唱！！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
